      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STARLIGHT SNOWY (2) gave a start after copping a check in running and missed the frame when a 2.25 lengths fourth (30.16) at this track in a Grade 5. Rates on top in this line up. YUNDERUP POCKETS (4) is rarely out of the finish, recording 17 places from 35 starts. Finished in the minors last time when third (28.23) at Mandurah making it back to back placings. Has a good record here including two wins. Form is hard to fault from this box, with a win and four minor placings from five starts. Expected to be in this for a long way. EXILE DANCER (1) has been a little hard to follow, finishing out of the placings latest but was in winning form two back scoring in a Novice race at this track. Can turn it around this time. TAKE MY ADVICE (5) is in form and worth thought again.",
